libtprl
------------------------------------------
This is a Readline library in C++.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libncurses-devel-6.5+20240427-1
  libreadline-devel-8.3-1
  libreadline8-8.3-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libtprl-devel-0.1.3+git20100322-1bl4
  libtprl1-0.1.3+git20100322-1bl4
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libncurses-devel-6.5+20240427-1
  libreadline-devel-8.3-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/thousandparsec/libtprl

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/thousandparsec/libtprl.git

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libtprl-0.1.3+git20100322-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libtprl-0.1.3+git20100322-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libtprl-0.1.3+git20100322-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libtprl-0.1.3+git20100322-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libtprl1-0.1.3+git20100322-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libtprl-devel-0.1.3+git20100322-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libtprl)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libtprl.README
  /usr/share/doc/libtprl/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libtprl/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libtprl/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libtprl/README

(libtprl1)
  /usr/bin/cygtprl-1.dll

(libtprl-devel)
  /usr/include/tprl/commandalias.h
  /usr/include/tprl/commandcategory.h
  /usr/include/tprl/console.h
  /usr/include/tprl/rlcommand.h
  /usr/lib/libtprl.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libtprl.pc

